--- a/PRODUCT.md
+++ b/PRODUCT.md
@@ -23,7 +23,7 @@
 ## Design Principles
 
 - Keep the learner's next action clear.
-- Keep classroom controls visually consistent across current and historical discussion. Desktop discussion choices and history actions use 36 px; playback controls use 30 px with 16 px icons in a 40 px toolbar. Coarse-pointer controls use 48 px. Voice capture remains a larger dedicated target.
+- Keep classroom controls visually consistent across current and historical discussion. Desktop discussion choices and history actions use 36 px; playback controls use 30 px with 16 px icons in a 40 px toolbar. Coarse-pointer controls use 48 px. Ordinary classroom buttons use the single `lib/ui/classroom-controls.ts` presentation contract in both native UI and isolated iframe tools; components and CSS Modules own layout only. Voice capture remains a larger dedicated target.
 - Scope the student theme to classroom chrome; preserve authored lesson and whiteboard content.
 - Preserve meaningful status labels and the existing interaction flow.
 
